  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A wunderkind may combine spheres and talents to create magical effects. A wunderkind is considered a High-Caster, and uses Charisma as her casting ability modifier. (Note: all casters gain 2 bonus talents and may refine their tradition the first time they gain the casting class feature. Wunderkinder begin with the Wild Magic and Magical Signs drawbacks (as described in her ability descriptions), as well as the Easy Focus boon.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/wunderkind#toc1\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
